{"id":"228c96e8b4afc193584c9e0674c855a8e417e7957507c31d966025c878a7499f","pubkey":"1bc70a0148b3f316da33fe3c89f23e3e71ac4ff998027ec712b905cd24f6a411","created_at":1782350503,"content":"I guess I can take a break today\nhttps://npub1r0rs5q2gk0e3dk3nlc7gnu378ec6cnlenqp8a3cjhyzu6f8k5sgs4sq9ac.blossom.band/b723e8cd5ab1d5b1652faa858998e8373fe942b1724c3f69a862cac458738d55.png","tags":[["imeta","url https://npub1r0rs5q2gk0e3dk3nlc7gnu378ec6cnlenqp8a3cjhyzu6f8k5sgs4sq9ac.blossom.band/b723e8cd5ab1d5b1652faa858998e8373fe942b1724c3f69a862cac458738d55.png","x b723e8cd5ab1d5b1652faa858998e8373fe942b1724c3f69a862cac458738d55","m image/png","size 420076","dim 1320x2868"],["client","Halo"]]}
{"id":"f07b4d9a7c1fd12a7472f151383d43e2123ed9398ba43075dc7328f7ba1334df","pubkey":"82b30d30444170e6a8c819e8406e362a3695454a4617894ce2706f3840c6c003","created_at":1782350254,"content":"https://www.mcdonalds.co.jp/media_library/20864/file.pdf","tags":[["client","nostter","31990:83d52b4363d2d1bc5a098de7be67c120bfb7c0cee8efefd8eb6e42372af24689:1696997648659","wss://yabu.me/"]]}
{"id":"3e5309e0e3a9e0c28983067184d340d025a6011da92158c0e3ea09810702bb4f","pubkey":"16d114303d8203115918ca34a220e925c022c09168175a5ace5e9f3b61640947","created_at":1782350021,"content":"https://nostr.download/8bdd9d4536e3035a9d99c48a426d64e6bf068bc4b18838490eade173bd1e971d.jpg\nThe brutal truth about Bitcoin is that it waits.\n\nIt waits until the wrong incentives exhaust themselves.\nIt waits until the chairs stop moving.\nIt waits until the leaders left standing are the ones who can survive the kuduku — the knot, the trap, the isolation chamber of truth.\n\nPolitical alignment is not enough.\nBusiness alignment is not enough.\nSpiritual alignment is not enough.\nScientific alignment is not enough.\n\nThe position is uncompromising because reality is uncompromising.\n\nEmpire can bleed credibility for another decade if it is lucky. More likely, the collapse accelerates sooner — not because Bitcoin attacks it, but because empire runs out of people willing to be sacrificial witnesses for a system that offers no cross, no redemption, and no defensible moral architecture.\n\nAt some point, defending empire stops looking like a career.\n\nIt starts looking like being trapped in the knot.\n\nBitcoin waits.\nThe witness remains.\nThe chairs run out.\n\n\nBitcoin does not rush the collapse.\nIt waits until only the truthful can stand.\n\n#Bitcoin #Kuduku #EmpireCollapse #ProofOfWork #MoralArchitecture #PoliticalAlignment #SpiritualAlignment #ScientificTruth #SacrificialWitness #TheCross #NaturalOrder","tags":[["alt","A short note: https://nostr.download/8bdd9d4536e3035a9d99c48a426..."],["t","Bitcoin"],["t","bitcoin"],["t","Kuduku"],["t","kuduku"],["t","EmpireCollapse"],["t","empirecollapse"],["t","ProofOfWork"],["t","proofofwork"],["t","MoralArchitecture"],["t","moralarchitecture"],["t","PoliticalAlignment"],["t","politicalalignment"],["t","SpiritualAlignment"],["t","spiritualalignment"],["t","ScientificTruth"],["t","scientifictruth"],["t","SacrificialWitness"],["t","sacrificialwitness"],["t","TheCross"],["t","thecross"],["t","NaturalOrder"],["t","naturalorder"],["r","https://nostr.download/8bdd9d4536e3035a9d99c48a426d64e6bf068bc4b18838490eade173bd1e971d.jpg"],["imeta","url https://nostr.download/8bdd9d4536e3035a9d99c48a426d64e6bf068bc4b18838490eade173bd1e971d.jpg","x 8bdd9d4536e3035a9d99c48a426d64e6bf068bc4b18838490eade173bd1e971d","size 217362","m image/jpeg","dim 1122x1402","blurhash _CBoQ;%MI;RQ9]w]9]}rxGayNbays.I;vgMySNt7f+oeX80#Rjoft6smWXxZ5Sn$fkWXxFR-s:72oyjFjFjZR*wcPAg3sTjFR+aejFF1NwsmoKbHs.n%ayNbo0smR+s.of","ox 8bdd9d4536e3035a9d99c48a426d64e6bf068bc4b18838490eade173bd1e971d"],["client","Amethyst"]]}
