{"id":"e0750566a0c1995c7185a1854b1d0b16b1e719ca868f42de0bb9ba81da0b1d28","pubkey":"81913081246d192c9a55951704270756b222094470b3171e58bb5e3c42ee8db5","created_at":1782345105,"content":"https://media.libernet.app/s/dRpLdQ.jpg","tags":[["alt","A short note: https://media.libernet.app/s/dRpLdQ.jpg"],["r","https://media.libernet.app/s/dRpLdQ.jpg"],["imeta","url https://media.libernet.app/s/dRpLdQ.jpg","x 5af10a7dd6e5cb61e42a4c37112cfed550b24a1d21ed536357a3912cfabd4b00","size 28648","m image/jpeg","dim 720x912","blurhash _JJ**NxuM{t7a#ofay~qofaykBj[f6j[D*WBofaya|ayj[%Mj@j[j[ayayjut7j[ayfQaxj[ayt7WBayaya{kBaya#ayj@aya{j[azofofj[ayj@fkfPayj[fiaykBayfQ","ox 5af10a7dd6e5cb61e42a4c37112cfed550b24a1d21ed536357a3912cfabd4b00"],["client","Amethyst"]]}
{"id":"c5361dfe3f200f115b30bf0bb9db38fe4823f2249f316ad91680fa4bd95a7bc3","pubkey":"81913081246d192c9a55951704270756b222094470b3171e58bb5e3c42ee8db5","created_at":1782345075,"content":"@Value_at_Risk\nhttps://media.libernet.app/s/l9Ufdd.jpg\n刷了会微博，主页被@峰哥亡命天涯 刷屏了，看了眼好像是和微博老股民们吵起来了，大概情况是峰哥最近买了AI产业链赚了不少钱，同时一直在发微博劝投资人赶紧抛弃老登拥抱AI，然后就有一些人一直在评论了喷，估计今天被喷的烦了才疯狂发帖。\n\n其中刷到的这条帖子（见图），我觉得还是有必要说两句，当然我不是要评价这个位置劝人买AI对不对，而是想说，这个人说的数据确实是没错的。长期来看，普通人炒股就是大多数会亏损，即便是超级牛市也是如此，比如2015年的数据很多人都看到过——2022年发表于《Journal of Monetary Economics》的论文《Wealth Redistribution in Bubbles and Crashes》（作者安砾、楼栋、施东辉），记录了2014年7月到2015年12月这轮行情。当时法人账户的持仓64%，交易量占比2%；机构持仓比例和交易量占比分别为11%和12%；个人投资者持仓25%，但交易量占比却接近90%。按金额分成四组看：0-50万元、50万元-300万元、300万元-1000万元、1000万元以上（账户数量占比分别为85%、12.5%、2%和0.5%），在2015年6月12日峰值过后，财富总量最高的个人投资者迅速退出了股票市场，并将其持有的股票卖给了其他个人投资者和法人账户。在2015年6月至2015年12月股票市场泡沫破裂时期，四组个人投资者的累计资金流入分别为-320亿元、-1370亿元、-1960亿元、-4730亿元。最后得到的结论是四组个人投资者的累计损益分别为−2500亿元、−420亿元、440亿元、2540亿元，即财富总量后85%的个人投资者因采取主动型投资策略损失了2500亿元，而财富总量前0.5%的个人投资者则赚取了2540亿元。该研究结论发人深省，即只有2.5%的高净值投资者在这轮行情波动中是赚钱的，85%的普通投资者的2500亿左右资金被0.5%的高端投资者给赚走了。不仅是A股在美股也是如此，美股普通人不买指数不买对龙头的话，大概率长期也是亏钱的，大多数个股不仅跑不赢指数，反而还是下跌的。\n\n峰哥可能没经历过几次完整的牛熊，对市场的认知不够深刻。我个人的建议（我也是这样做的），在大多数时候都不要鼓吹让人进场买股票，反而要不断的提示股市的风险，提示行业、公司潜在可能会遇到的风险，特别是在牛市时，应该更多多的提示风险。因为你踏空顶多是不赚钱，而高位接盘那可是要真亏钱。我只有在深度熊市的时候，才会发声呼吁让大家尝试抄底，但也一定会提示各种风险做好最坏的预期。\n\n最后，我想起来很早之前一个小故事，99年-00年美科技股疯狂上涨，当年美总统克林顿想把股市上涨的功劳揽到自己身上作为选票筹码。而时任财长鲁宾曾这样告诫克林顿:“总统先生，股市涨成这样，你千万别出去邀功说是自己的功劳。”克林顿问，“为什么呢？”鲁宾说：“因为股市涨上去，它还会再跌下来”。","tags":[["alt","A short note: @Value_at_Risk\nhttps://media.libernet.app/s/l9Ufdd..."],["r","https://月这轮行情。当时法人账户的持仓/"],["r","https://刷了会微博，主页被@峰哥亡命天涯/"],["r","https://年美科技股疯狂上涨，当年美总统克林顿想把股市上涨的功劳揽到自己身上作为选票筹码。而时任财长鲁宾曾这样告诫克林顿/"],["r","https://对不对，而是想说，这个人说的数据确实是没错的。长期来看，普通人炒股就是大多数会亏损，即便是超级牛市也是如此，比如/"],["r","https://“总统先生，股市涨成这样，你千万别出去邀功说是自己的功劳。”克林顿问，“为什么呢？”鲁宾说：“因为股市涨上去，它还会再跌下来”/"],["r","https://亿元。最后得到的结论是四组个人投资者的累计损益分别为−/"],["r","https://亿元。该研究结论发人深省，即只有/"],["r","https://media.libernet.app/s/l9Ufdd.jpg"],["r","https://90。按金额分成四组看：/"],["r","https://的高端投资者给赚走了。不仅是/"],["r","https://峰哥可能没经历过几次完整的牛熊，对市场的认知不够深刻。我个人的建议（我也是这样做的），在大多数时候都不要鼓吹让人进场买股票，反而要不断的提示股市的风险，提示行业、公司潜在可能会遇到的风险，特别是在牛市时，应该更多多的提示风险。因为你踏空顶多是不赚钱，而高位接盘那可是要真亏钱。我只有在深度熊市的时候，才会发声呼吁让大家尝试抄底，但也一定会提示各种风险做好最坏的预期/"],["imeta","url https://media.libernet.app/s/l9Ufdd.jpg","x b786441f1ed4d40f4e24475bc00de0173ec819b853995a64bbc77a7c53ce381b","size 58699","m image/jpeg","dim 935x677","blurhash r5R{#?xZ?b?c-;tRozt7Ri~p4mD%Rkay%Mof%MRjbJNGD%IURit7V@IUoz?bRiROMxS4NHM{RjkC_3D%9Ft8RjRjoej[M{t5WBkXR.s:RPjrM{V@","ox b786441f1ed4d40f4e24475bc00de0173ec819b853995a64bbc77a7c53ce381b"],["client","Amethyst"]]}
{"id":"1c25a8e757ccb9a0de461584467360d55d27504fca2152897b376b1910b2ae2d","pubkey":"16d114303d8203115918ca34a220e925c022c09168175a5ace5e9f3b61640947","created_at":1782344513,"content":"https://nostr.download/3d04fc73bae7ce2764cf1340515f7835e451398a7648bb1791035c7f6eb6dfad.jpg\n\nMalayalam and Japanese are not related by bloodline.\n\nThey are related by listening.\n\nA Malayalee watching a Japanese show does not always understand the words, but often understands the pressure underneath them.\n\nThe hesitation.\nThe restraint.\nThe insult hidden inside politeness.\nThe sorrow hidden inside silence.\nThe threat hidden inside honour.\nThe love hidden inside refusal.\n\nThat is the bridge.\n\nMalayalam trains the ear for emotional curvature.\nA word can bend into affection, warning, mockery, grief, prayer, or surrender depending on how it lands.\n\nJapanese trains the scene around restraint.\nMeaning is carried through pitch, pause, distance, status, silence, and what is left unsaid.\n\nBoth languages punish flat listening.\n\nEnglish often asks:\n“What did he say?”\n\nMalayalam and Japanese ask:\n“What was carried through the saying?”\n\nThat is why a Malayalee can watch Japanese drama and feel the knot tighten before the subtitle arrives.\n\nNot because the languages are the same.\n\nBecause both preserve the ancient truth:\n\nspeech is not just information.\nspeech is pressure, relation, wound, honour, and release.\n\nThe words differ.\nThe metaphysics rhymes.\n\n#Malayalam #Japanese #Language #MetaLinguistics #Kodoku #Kudukku #LastSamuraiStanding #Culture #Intonation #TheUnsaid","tags":[["alt","A short note: https://nostr.download/3d04fc73bae7ce2764cf1340515..."],["t","Malayalam"],["t","malayalam"],["t","Japanese"],["t","japanese"],["t","Language"],["t","language"],["t","MetaLinguistics"],["t","metalinguistics"],["t","Kodoku"],["t","kodoku"],["t","Kudukku"],["t","kudukku"],["t","LastSamuraiStanding"],["t","lastsamuraistanding"],["t","Culture"],["t","culture"],["t","Intonation"],["t","intonation"],["t","TheUnsaid"],["t","theunsaid"],["r","https://nostr.download/3d04fc73bae7ce2764cf1340515f7835e451398a7648bb1791035c7f6eb6dfad.jpg"],["imeta","url https://nostr.download/3d04fc73bae7ce2764cf1340515f7835e451398a7648bb1791035c7f6eb6dfad.jpg","x 3d04fc73bae7ce2764cf1340515f7835e451398a7648bb1791035c7f6eb6dfad","size 220386","m image/jpeg","dim 1024x1536","blurhash ^KBo,Bsk57S5xYof~Bn#E2R.j@kC^kjrIVS5bHoL^joIM|WYR+oLS%j?wua}I;WWoMayaxWXR+jZRnjsxXWVNIfQENj[%0ayWCayV[j[baWVn%jZ","ox 3d04fc73bae7ce2764cf1340515f7835e451398a7648bb1791035c7f6eb6dfad"],["client","Amethyst"]]}
{"id":"a55feac34801eea3a05bacd2028d37b49aeb7e7073230dd186663ae42a42c96e","pubkey":"16d114303d8203115918ca34a220e925c022c09168175a5ace5e9f3b61640947","created_at":1782344108,"content":"https://nostr.download/cbf9d53e058ff0773c4498469da82cd46beda291a6e5e7fe3f023c2b81560b7b.jpg\nFunny how language exposes the mechanism before the historian does.\n\nIn Japanese, Kodoku is the sealed jar — the death ritual where life is trapped until only the most poisonous survivor remains.\n\nIn Malayalam, Kudukku sounds like the knot — the loop, the snare, the binding that catches the living inside the mechanism.\n\nMaybe the words are not related.\n\nBut the symbols know each other.\n\nThe jar is the system.\nThe knot is the contract.\nThe survivor is the poison empire produces when it binds abandoned men into games of necessity.\n\nThat is the deeper cut of Last Samurai Standing.\n\nThe samurai are not merely fighting.\nThey are caught.\n\nCaught between old honour and new money.\nCaught between service and survival.\nCaught between the death of a world and the birth of a machine.\n\nKodoku is the jar.\nKudukku is the knot.\nEmpire is what happens when both become policy.\n\n#LastSamuraiStanding #Kodoku #Kudukku #Language #Empire #Samurai #MetaLinguistics #NaturalOrder #Survival #TheKnot ","tags":[["alt","A short note: https://nostr.download/cbf9d53e058ff0773c4498469da..."],["t","LastSamuraiStanding"],["t","lastsamuraistanding"],["t","Kodoku"],["t","kodoku"],["t","Kudukku"],["t","kudukku"],["t","Language"],["t","language"],["t","Empire"],["t","empire"],["t","Samurai"],["t","samurai"],["t","MetaLinguistics"],["t","metalinguistics"],["t","NaturalOrder"],["t","naturalorder"],["t","Survival"],["t","survival"],["t","TheKnot"],["t","theknot"],["r","https://nostr.download/cbf9d53e058ff0773c4498469da82cd46beda291a6e5e7fe3f023c2b81560b7b.jpg"],["imeta","url https://nostr.download/cbf9d53e058ff0773c4498469da82cd46beda291a6e5e7fe3f023c2b81560b7b.jpg","x cbf9d53e058ff0773c4498469da82cd46beda291a6e5e7fe3f023c2b81560b7b","size 166253","m image/jpeg","dim 1122x1402","blurhash _99%bVEN9a-:fkRPIV~Vt8M|%1kCIoWBNz?GWANIs:M{s.NL-:xZIqxaWANG-:fkaea}ofs.Ip-oRjM|xtj[WBjZjER*WrxZayR+t6jYRkWCj?aya#oe4.RjxtRkWBt7of","ox cbf9d53e058ff0773c4498469da82cd46beda291a6e5e7fe3f023c2b81560b7b"],["client","Amethyst"]]}
