{"id":"f5382598274f709527cf5b7214ce4797cd279c6b7f069e38ae244f7c2c02cf62","pubkey":"5b3f692693e6cb60f43896001120e8e2c46fb606b75473101c17cfea84a767d8","created_at":1782340961,"content":"From level 2 to level 5 my character became a werewolf getting a wolpsy 40+ for STR, SPD, AGL and END and some physical skills, them she got Hircine's Ring to null the very few downsides of being a werewolf, afterwards she got 3 other daedric artifacts: Molag's Mace for big bonks and MP drains, Azure's Star, and Oghama Infinium for extra 30 stats pts (all put into LUC), it took some errands for two different covens of witch, but look at this OP shit, it's a LVL 5 CHAR LMAO.\nhttps://i.nostr.build/tURuPnuAo5VvtjZa.png\nhttps://i.nostr.build/gJ6YfA0b0SrVw4Kw.png\nhttps://i.nostr.build/DXR4oWtvWmSBnbW1.png\n\nThe game seems unforgivable at first and some may not even leave tutorial, but with preparation you can manage it and with some gameplay time you discover it allows big shit.\n","tags":[["alt","A short note: From level 2 to level 5 my character became a were..."],["r","https://i.nostr.build/DXR4oWtvWmSBnbW1.png"],["r","https://i.nostr.build/tURuPnuAo5VvtjZa.png"],["r","https://i.nostr.build/gJ6YfA0b0SrVw4Kw.png"]]}
