{"id":"c9386a3f887faaceba4d1534690cdc7208c69b16fd683feba97d1ff62ba169ee","pubkey":"e0a8cbd75ebfe4efbba8a65ff54bb435858404f6dc0ba4a6458a24d7f642d154","created_at":1782340358,"content":"今日の朝食もホテルでビュフェ、美味しくいただきました\nhttps://image.nostr.build/79ae3e78bccb1d1335fac5e1d762d93e15c95c7ee1889ef3b422f2e49a59cec7.jpg","tags":[]}
{"id":"3577b119f77ee0ddff14c21ee7b754b79f1f54d0e093350e405229fd42301f17","pubkey":"16d114303d8203115918ca34a220e925c022c09168175a5ace5e9f3b61640947","created_at":1782340285,"content":"https://nostr.download/883617846c5e9353e6dfb6e41fc3825a85524a62a6c75ad7beceb3ab5535b84a.jpg\nEvery attempt at human connection inside the empire stack becomes another funnel, another app, another verification code, another broken signup flow.\n\n“Community” gets packaged as a mobile product.\n“Local connection” gets routed through surveillance infrastructure.\n“Joy” gets mediated by ratings, ads, insurance brands, and dark-pattern onboarding.\n\nAnd when the thing fails to even localize basic human contact, empire does not stop.\n\nIt just stacks more bodies on the altar and calls it growth.\n\nThe failure is not technical.\nThe failure is architectural.\n\nYou cannot app-store your way back to community after replacing place, trust, and shared life with extractive interfaces.\n\n\nEmpire turned community into an app.\nThen wondered why nobody could connect.\n\n\n\n#EmpireStack #HumanConnection #LocalCommunity #MobileEcosystems #PlatformDecay #AppStoreDystopia #SurveillanceCapitalism #DigitalExhaustion #ArchitectureMatters #DamageBDD","tags":[["alt","A short note: https://nostr.download/883617846c5e9353e6dfb6e41fc..."],["t","EmpireStack"],["t","empirestack"],["t","HumanConnection"],["t","humanconnection"],["t","LocalCommunity"],["t","localcommunity"],["t","MobileEcosystems"],["t","mobileecosystems"],["t","PlatformDecay"],["t","platformdecay"],["t","AppStoreDystopia"],["t","appstoredystopia"],["t","SurveillanceCapitalism"],["t","surveillancecapitalism"],["t","DigitalExhaustion"],["t","digitalexhaustion"],["t","ArchitectureMatters"],["t","architecturematters"],["t","DamageBDD"],["t","damagebdd"],["r","https://nostr.download/883617846c5e9353e6dfb6e41fc3825a85524a62a6c75ad7beceb3ab5535b84a.jpg"],["imeta","url https://nostr.download/883617846c5e9353e6dfb6e41fc3825a85524a62a6c75ad7beceb3ab5535b84a.jpg","x 883617846c5e9353e6dfb6e41fc3825a85524a62a6c75ad7beceb3ab5535b84a","size 185106","m image/jpeg","dim 1122x1402","blurhash _A9jcW~pRjM{NGRjE1?u-;RjRQoefkV@?b%MIVRjt7R*M|MxMxoLkCkCt7R*E1NGWBoLs:Rjay9FM{t7ofj[ofjtMxRQt7WqWVs:ofNGkCt7jZaebGofRjoLt7bHWBj[s:","ox 883617846c5e9353e6dfb6e41fc3825a85524a62a6c75ad7beceb3ab5535b84a"],["client","Amethyst"]]}
