{"id":"e25049e6d5ca6a34af9e6cef236dce0ad49064aef51dd4c26dd9900d0db4ea6c","pubkey":"7ab2fc7ee0fe86f7ea155fe27999d6e89014b3aa93ddaa8020dad17ac4d30428","created_at":1782339700,"content":"https://t.me/Yayayagroup114/2392 #复制粘贴\n真拿你没办法，坐好了。\n\n给你介绍个对象，她是一个来自江西，身材微胖，长相七分，家里有个弟弟，武汉大学法学院毕业，性格慢热，有几个黑人男闺蜜，还有几个当老师的女闺蜜，喜欢仪式感，喜欢摄影，尤其是喜欢给黑人体育生Raper摄影，数码产品只在京东上买OPPO手机和罗技外设，爱旅游，爱健身，爱宠（尤其是猫猫，比小孩可爱！）爱烘焙，自学中医，爱玩原神和乙游，最喜欢的角色是散兵大人和秦彻大人，国拟（最喜欢霓虹球和咱妈球，超好磕的家人们谁懂啊）喜欢看的电影是战狼还有监狱来的妈妈和哪吒（全部二十刷）爱看小说和写小说，写过风情不摇晃和霸道军阀爱上我（前者是写帅气毒枭爱上我，后者是以她为原型的富家千金穿越回1921年，为了她的霸道军阀老公能和她创立百年世家，女主去炸了嘉兴南湖上的一条小船的文）喜欢交友，尤其是外国人（限定黑皮和白皮，超雷黄皮亚洲人）热爱塔罗牌和十二星座和历史，历史最喜欢魏晋与明清了呢，经常使用微博和小红书，喜欢的明星有（赵露思，范冰冰，黄杨钿甜，吴亦凡，李易峰，赵爽，傅首尔，杨笠，时代少年团，TNT，蔡徐坤）正全职考公，如果没考上准备负债四十万加盟哪吒仙饮和老兵烧烤#女性不被定义#父权制#结构性压迫#制度性歧视#系统性不平等#交叉性#交叉性女性主义#种族#阶级#性取向#性别认同#性别表达#顺性别特权#异性恋霸权#酷儿#跨性别女性#性别二元论#性别光谱#性别平等#女性权力#女性自由#女性赋权#女性主义#女性主义浪潮#女性意识#女性觉醒#去性别刻板印象#性别角色社会化#性别规训#女性困境#生存困境#系统性压迫#隐性歧视#微观侵犯#男性说教#煤气灯效应#身体自主#身体主权#我的身体我的选择#生殖正义#生育自主#生育自由#堕胎权#不生育权#自愿无子女#性自主#性同意#性教育#性暴力#性侵#性骚扰#反性骚扰#MeToo#打破沉默#受害者无罪#反性别暴力#反家暴#亲密伴侣暴力#网络暴力#人身安全#女性安全#月经#月经贫困#月经羞耻#经期歧视#月经正义#月经平等#卫生巾自由#更年期#更年期去污名化#女性健康#妇科健康#生殖健康#性健康#心理健康#女性心理健康#产后抑郁#身体形象#饮食障碍#经济独立#财务自主#女性职场#同工同酬#薪酬公平#反薪酬歧视#职场歧视#孕产歧视#母职惩罚#职业中断#重返职场#灵活工作#女性领导力#职场女性#粉红税#无偿照料#照料劳动#看不见的劳动#情感劳动#情绪劳动#认知劳动#精神负荷#家务劳动#家务平等#第二班#母职#密集母职#母职神话#母职焦虑#工作母职冲突#父职#婚育自主#婚姻自主#不婚主义#单身自由#反催婚#反催生#离婚自主#单身女性#独居女性#女性友谊#女性互助#女性团结#Girls help girls#女性成长#独立女性#主体性#边界感#拒绝讨好#自律#女性力量#女性韧性#女性叙事#女性表达#女性写作#女性创作者#女性艺术#女性文学#女性电影#女导演#女性凝视#女性视角#女性故事#她历史#女性历史#女性史#隐藏的历史#被遗忘的女性#女性榜样#女性参政#女性政治参与#女性投票权#女性决策#拒绝容貌焦虑#身体接纳#身体积极性#拒绝body shame#反身材歧视#反肥胖歧视#服美役#拒服美役#素颜自由#穿衣自由#女性审美#外貌焦虑#年龄焦虑#教育平等#女童教育#STEM女性#女性主义阅读#性别平等教育#反性别刻板教育#女童赋能#月经教育#青春期教育#无酬劳动价值#时间贫困#休闲权#休息权#宝宝辅食的身高一米五，体重三万五千吨的肉感妹妹一枚呀\n#抽象小文案 #会心一啸","tags":[["alt","A short note: https://t.me/Yayayagroup114/2392 #复制粘贴\n真拿你没办法，坐好了。..."],["t","复制粘贴"],["t","抽象小文案"],["t","会心一啸"],["r","https://t.me/Yayayagroup114/2392"],["client","Amethyst"]]}
{"id":"a1638a7659cd7954ac247c75192b7e9eff7516b5f7b29ff077d81cac01e88197","pubkey":"16d114303d8203115918ca34a220e925c022c09168175a5ace5e9f3b61640947","created_at":1782338329,"content":"A state that claims such a thing as victory has already confessed its defeat.\nhttps://nostr.download/65bab4951ae45f9680c7fde3ddf69020e80a983f40c6bcfbebeca7bd2a436054.jpg\nBecause the moment a government treats the instrumental use of human tissue as triumph, it has committed the cardinal sin of dehumanization.\n\nIt has lowered its population from persons to substrate.\nFrom citizens to inventory.\nFrom souls under protection to meat under management.\n\nThat is not scientific glory.\nThat is moral collapse wearing the language of progress.\n\nA healthy civilization protects the human being as the subject of law, dignity, and consent.\n\nA dying civilization reduces the human being to usable biological material and then calls the reduction an achievement.\n\nThat is the tell.\n\nWhen the state celebrates the conversion of life into infrastructure, it is no longer serving the people.\n\nIt is consuming them.\n\n\nA state that calls it victory has already fallen.\nIts people are no longer citizens.\nThey are just meat to the machine.\n\n#HumanRights #Bioethics #HumanDignity #MedicalEthics #ResearchEthics #InformedConsent #ConsentMatters #HumanTissue #HumanTissueIsNotInfrastructure #HumanBeingsAreNotResources #NoConsentNoExperiment #NoAuditNoSystem #NoWitnessNoLegitimacy #Neuroethics #Biotechnology #Biopolitics #StatePower #Dehumanization #MoralCollapse #EthicalAI #Verification #Auditability #ChainOfCustody #DamageBDD #ECAI","tags":[["alt","A short note: A state that claims such a thing as victory has al..."],["t","HumanRights"],["t","humanrights"],["t","Bioethics"],["t","bioethics"],["t","HumanDignity"],["t","humandignity"],["t","MedicalEthics"],["t","medicalethics"],["t","ResearchEthics"],["t","researchethics"],["t","InformedConsent"],["t","informedconsent"],["t","ConsentMatters"],["t","consentmatters"],["t","HumanTissue"],["t","humantissue"],["t","HumanTissueIsNotInfrastructure"],["t","humantissueisnotinfrastructure"],["t","HumanBeingsAreNotResources"],["t","humanbeingsarenotresources"],["t","NoConsentNoExperiment"],["t","noconsentnoexperiment"],["t","NoAuditNoSystem"],["t","noauditnosystem"],["t","NoWitnessNoLegitimacy"],["t","nowitnessnolegitimacy"],["t","Neuroethics"],["t","neuroethics"],["t","Biotechnology"],["t","biotechnology"],["t","Biopolitics"],["t","biopolitics"],["t","StatePower"],["t","statepower"],["t","Dehumanization"],["t","dehumanization"],["t","MoralCollapse"],["t","moralcollapse"],["t","EthicalAI"],["t","ethicalai"],["t","Verification"],["t","verification"],["t","Auditability"],["t","auditability"],["t","ChainOfCustody"],["t","chainofcustody"],["t","DamageBDD"],["t","damagebdd"],["t","ECAI"],["t","ecai"],["r","https://nostr.download/65bab4951ae45f9680c7fde3ddf69020e80a983f40c6bcfbebeca7bd2a436054.jpg"],["imeta","url https://nostr.download/65bab4951ae45f9680c7fde3ddf69020e80a983f40c6bcfbebeca7bd2a436054.jpg","x 65bab4951ae45f9680c7fde3ddf69020e80a983f40c6bcfbebeca7bd2a436054","size 204357","m image/jpeg","dim 1054x1492","blurhash ^79P=*=yIo%f9ZRQx],@s;pHM{RP}[jFIokWRjsAX-W.R*s:niofQ-Rjs.WCt6ofJ8wJRPM|t7t7m,t7%2RPkWkCKOkWWBV@j[X8ozTJbbnhn%WV","ox 65bab4951ae45f9680c7fde3ddf69020e80a983f40c6bcfbebeca7bd2a436054"],["client","Amethyst"]]}
{"id":"2b1036c405579a2d3e5d73dc902a867f5f2e2bdbea2e728589ee038d63a4b076","pubkey":"a1fc5dfd7ffcf563c89155b466751b580d115e136e2f8c90e8913385bbedb1cf","created_at":1782338154,"content":" https://blossom.primal.net/2b42351cdc2e813483746ebec8c02be1eac0c92eb70ca4100c03579a8d0cccda.png \n\nI feel like BTC just has to go down in this part of the cycle and that includes even when it makes no sense.  \n\nMSTR and @saylor ain't selling shit, 32 BTC won't move the needle in a second let alone a day or a week.  \n\nETFs keep stacking and are not dumping.  \n\nI am not selling, I don't know anyone who is selling but I know a lot of buyers.  It doesn't have to make sense.  \n\nI have been on this train since 2012, this is just the ride that is required if you want the upside.  Hold on folks, no matter what your insta-fluncer of choice says, the bottom comes in from Oct-Nov of this year in the cycle.  \n\nWe ain't bottomed yet!   More to come, hands up, enjoy the dips, the banked turns and the loops.  \n\nOh and DCA every fuckin day!","tags":[["r","wss://nostr.wine/"],["r","wss://groups.0xchat.com/"],["r","wss://nostr.bitcoiner.social/"],["r","wss://relay.damus.io/"],["r","wss://nos.lol/"],["r","wss://eden.nostr.land/"],["r","wss://relay.primal.net/"],["r","wss://relay.0xchat.com/"],["r","wss://yabu.me/"],["imeta","url https://blossom.primal.net/2b42351cdc2e813483746ebec8c02be1eac0c92eb70ca4100c03579a8d0cccda.png","m image/png","dim 2532x1272","service nip96"],["client","Primal Web"]]}
