{"id":"ace704c584ba3517ea0f2fc2183f7bb1f7ea91e7928490e072706bbacaaf15a6","pubkey":"000000005e9dda01479c76c5f4fccbaebe4e7856e02f8e85adba05ad62ad6927","created_at":1782326580,"content":"My yogurt maker stopped working properly. It couldn't heat the water above 38°C (around something Fahrenheit).\n\nI opened the thing to look inside it's guts and the plastic where screws holds that heating pad down was rotten and the heater barely made any contact with a metal plate.\nhttps://blossom.yakihonne.com/b4aa2f6b20f4f2e62217706d88a7409156b9864a1053e37c13df49d047837611.jpeg\nhttps://blossom.yakihonne.com/9e573ee4ee108ab0507a0260dd3f6084eaa51dd1dbb98581eb4d3ca709fd79ef.jpeg\n\nI decided to chose my right to repair card and fixed it by melting the plastic, dip in the brass insert nuts and screwed back the heater and that was it. \nhttps://blossom.yakihonne.com/e04aa2cd238b8a465de9ac656ee6fc3af2574221e1fa4e19d76a36d015f61786.jpeg\nhttps://blossom.yakihonne.com/f256537d4644674951ecbe00542c3c18565012040f3f4658b44bbf0ae50381a0.jpeg\nhttps://blossom.yakihonne.com/94ba1b10febdff34a2fe1d8bd0e515399a65bdedb2f42f5ae2b377a443f767e1.jpeg\n\n\nI just saved 50€ with a tiny bit of work.\n","tags":[["alt","A short note: My yogurt maker stopped working properly. It could..."],["r","https://blossom.yakihonne.com/9e573ee4ee108ab0507a0260dd3f6084eaa51dd1dbb98581eb4d3ca709fd79ef.jpeg"],["r","https://blossom.yakihonne.com/e04aa2cd238b8a465de9ac656ee6fc3af2574221e1fa4e19d76a36d015f61786.jpeg"],["r","https://blossom.yakihonne.com/94ba1b10febdff34a2fe1d8bd0e515399a65bdedb2f42f5ae2b377a443f767e1.jpeg"],["r","https://blossom.yakihonne.com/b4aa2f6b20f4f2e62217706d88a7409156b9864a1053e37c13df49d047837611.jpeg"],["r","https://blossom.yakihonne.com/f256537d4644674951ecbe00542c3c18565012040f3f4658b44bbf0ae50381a0.jpeg"],["imeta","url https://blossom.yakihonne.com/b4aa2f6b20f4f2e62217706d88a7409156b9864a1053e37c13df49d047837611.jpeg","x b4aa2f6b20f4f2e62217706d88a7409156b9864a1053e37c13df49d047837611","size 33