{"id":"1d3faf7a8010cb6834f9544fcdd343bda9d70801bc90e7438ad4a81b7b56d040","pubkey":"19f9afb8f855f5e86b5bea160e78ec5871648b10dedb043f4806fca8ce50e4d3","created_at":1782313740,"content":"Gonna give ya a #rupertsbackyardtoday tour really quick then I gotta get out the door.\n\n*climb* *climb* rawr! (lowercase roar for lowercase scares) \nhttps://cdn.satellite.earth/1ef90fcd0cb4fda92bc678115a3e13877dff7e1fbf58cc273f2133174e76d1b6.jpg\n\nFresh banana leaf, always fun! (No pooper today.)\nhttps://cdn.satellite.earth/8b866db2d11246432d8e1ecb26d3e4f370c45bb045d383ee1b999807437c9ff1.jpg\n\nIt's REALLY hard to get a picture of a robber fly that doesn't like paparazzi. I got this guy twice!\nhttps://cdn.satellite.earth/ee04c6851ce3320f151f7c0ffc5bb15cc119972fb5ba0b74a30c0eaf93dee627.jpg\n\nnostr:nprofile1qqstgfw7a9ar3984kx63yfk4jg7gd6fr5zgrngm2gtsqmnvl59mrqvgpz9mhxue69uhkummnw3ezuamfdejj7qg6waehxw309ac8ymmxd9kx2uewdehhxarjxyhxxmmd9uqsuamnwvaz7tmwdaejumr0dshsmxlqyc were you asking about my belladonna recently? Here she is, wild grown. We mostly leave her be until nostr:nprofile1qqsrg8d45l36jv05jz2as2j2ejfee79xw2fmreqhnl2ttsz5f38u9mcprfmhxue69uhk2mrfw3jhxtnwdaehgunpw35jummjvuhszyrhwden5te0dehhxarj9ekk7mf0qy88wumn8ghj7mn0wvhxcmmv9uqrga6f hits her with the weed whacker.\n https://cdn.satellite.earth/3d198e988f8dad9432c2e358f4ad3da010433b0c1832df793525acb1e86d0653.jpg\n\nnostr:nprofile1qqspe8wd3lfd97u8n4hs94kv26hwl462jeu2ujzrfv8smeazrpf0wpqpz4mhxue69uhhyetvv9ujuerpd46hxtnfduhszrnhwden5te0dehhxtnvdakz7qg3waehxw309ahx7um5wgh8w6twv5hsdx9xkw the same little (probably) shaggy ink caps from yesterday from 3 angles.\nhttps://cdn.satellite.earth/3d98e40e24dab2f927a9e82e962984cb3d642ff89f8727eb4822bd210171f277.jpg\n\nMoreshrooms!\nhttps://cdn.satellite.earth/74c7d83bda03c76fe380c63c62a1b78355c0f875841db96ff05b34f255e5669d.jpg\n\nI do believe she likes this spot. (If you guys remember I was \"just testing it out\" about a month or so ago.) I think a portion will go in the ground here, not the whole thing. (I also have cuttings of this bb if anyone wants some.)\nhttps://cdn.satellite.earth/4e12a6e0e6b21cad7835e8046157dfe2b9392c2daff817dc17a2083edaba55f1.jpg\n\nAnd last, but certainly not least... I spotted the spiderwort bloom, opened the camera on my phone, leaned in for a shot of the flower, and this little fella had decided it was time for his closeup. He definitely wasn't there when I decided to snap a pic or two of the bloom.\nhttps://cdn.satellite.earth/ba759c87ac900dba7a58ffd4420bbe64de83093ebe1bc1c8a721988505877918.jpg","tags":[["alt","A short note: Gonna give ya a #rupertsbackyardtoday tour really ..."],["p","b425dee97a3894f5b1b51226d5923c86e923a09039a36a42e00dcd9fa1763031","wss://nostr.wine/"],["p","341db5a7e3a931f49095d82a4acc939cf8a67293b1e4179fd4b5c0544c4fc2ef","wss://elites.nostrati.org/"],["p","1c9dcd8fd2d2fb879d6f02d6cc56aeefd74a9678ae48434b0f0de7a21852f704","wss://relay.damus.io/"],["t","rupertsbackyardtoday"],["r","https://cdn.satellite.earth/1ef90fcd0cb4fda92bc678115a3e13877dff7e1fbf58cc273f2133174e76d1b6.jpg"],["r","https://cdn.satellite.earth/74c7d83bda03c76fe380c63c62a1b78355c0f875841db96ff05b34f255e5669d.jpg"],["r","https://cdn.satellite.earth/8b866db2d11246432d8e1ecb26d3e4f370c45bb045d383ee1b999807437c9ff1.jpg"],["r","https://cdn.satellite.earth/3d198e988f8dad9432c2e358f4ad3da010433b0c1832df793525acb1e86d0653.jpg"],["r","https://cdn.satellite.earth/4e12a6e0e6b21cad7835e8046157dfe2b9392c2daff817dc17a2083edaba55f1.jpg"],["r","https://cdn.satellite.earth/ba759c87ac900dba7a58ffd4420bbe64de83093ebe1bc1c8a721988505877918.jpg"],["r","https://cdn.satellite.earth/3d98e40e24dab2f927a9e82e962984cb3d642ff89f8727eb4822bd210171f277.jpg"],["r","https://cdn.satellite.earth/ee04c6851ce3320f151f7c0ffc5bb15cc119972fb5ba0b74a30c0eaf93dee627.jpg"],["imeta","url https://cdn.satellite.earth/1ef90fcd0cb4fda92bc678115a3e13877dff7e1fbf58cc273f2133174e76d1b6.jpg","x 1ef90fcd0cb4fda92bc678115a3e13877dff7e1fbf58cc273f2133174e76d1b6","size 87356","m image/jpeg