{"id":"c1691f8cd9197612128946f5e527e601c79db79672099631907e06ea68260903","pubkey":"b0d99e2587e4e4a571ae7ae53430e97a2226c9a2d56c68b44b71576f9c7ad2c4","created_at":1782300054,"content":"BTC to BTC transaction in the wallet are private. Once you convert, banks are involved. We report aggregates yearly (bitcoin bought, bitcoin sold) (see here: https://help.bringin.xyz/en/articles/15392537-what-data-is-bringin-required-to-report-under-dac8)\n\nSo your final receiving bank doesn't know that Bitcoin is involved. But we do, and we need to report that when we report the aggregate.\n\nIf it is or it is not a taxable event depends on the country, but generally speaking yes. \n\n","tags":[["p","b0d99e2587e4e4a571ae7ae53430e97a2226c9a2d56c68b44b71576f9c7ad2c4","","mention"],["p","314072c16fa9433e1374f62e5b02c8163946ed298a9cde3b1541513c29d19fff"],["e","abe39bd29ef179cad1ba428af1dbbf98a24e209078b876a0fe422bbdf1ec67c5","","root","314072c16fa9433e1374f62e5b02c8163946ed298a9cde3b1541513c29d19fff"],["client","Primal Android"]]}
{"id":"1f1d7af846934d8a894e0d1c2b70dae5444855af75ec57ee80eb45f9e7cfbe09","pubkey":"f07e0b1af066b4838386360a1a2cbb374429a9fbaab593027f3fcd3bd3b5c367","created_at":1782299966,"content":"New Kubo release 🐵\n\nThis week’s update makes Kubo easier to use and safer by default.\n\nParents can now search for YouTube channels and add them directly to their child’s feed. That means children only see videos from channels their parent has personally approved. We also removed the option to turn off Trust Extended Permissions. Kubo is built around trust for safety, so protecting the child feed is now always on.\n\nOther improvements:\n- Simpler language throughout the app\n- Fullscreen kid videos in landscape\n- New Support page for bugs and feedback\n- Many 🪲 fixes\n\nIf you’d like to help us shape Kubo, download it here: https://zapstore.dev/apps/com.kubo.app \nAnd join the testers group on Signal: https://signal.group/#CjQKIPO-NzpZJHdFTKUD76Uc2aptmPn8b4G1P_7IVK8ezXDcEhBU4FtP4T4Rh8sXd_-1rmAo \nhttps://blossom.primal.net/a5a7d075e88c7a1445dd7836b79e107eedc6ae007d785d4e4237a80a71cf4f3d.png\nnostr:npub1w0tf5rw6hzcjextvc83ct0n8wwk6n848tudnnxxugxm4jj0vqpcs6t3snn nostr:npub1kdstrkmhv0yx8pdqcf9ed8l26752gqprx68twg7qp5nsd7qtegnsr3nsze nostr:npub1t6jxfqz9hv0lygn9thwndekuahwyxkgvycyscjrtauuw73gd5k7sqvksrw nostr:npub1qe3e5wrvnsgpggtkytxteaqfprz0rgxr8c3l34kk3a9t7e2l3acslezefe","tags":[["t","cjqkipo"],["p","73d69a0ddab8b12c996cc1e385be6773ada99ea75f1b3998dc41b75949ec0071"],["p","b360b1db7763c86385a0c24b969fead7a8a40023368eb723c00d2706f80bca27"],["p","5ea4648045bb1ff222655ddd36e6dceddc43590c26090c486bef38ef450da5bd"],["p","06639a386c9c1014217622ccbcf40908c4f1a0c33e23f8d6d68f4abf655f8f71"]]}
