{"id":"a1d5162be873f7adc497e3018102cbb1483ef474a8ea5c9fae91d0e1b4051e59","pubkey":"83bad0334e312208396ebfd6a7bd41baf55d2496149ebecbac1ae8b0c795062d","created_at":1782291600,"content":"Four Years Post-Dobbs, Corporate Media’s Abortion Fearmongering Proves More False Than Ever\n\nhttps://thefederalist.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Untitled-design-3.jpg\nCorporate media spewed several crazy predictions after the Supreme Court’s 2022 Dobbs v. Jackson ruling. None of them came true.\n\nhttps://thefederalist.com/2026/06/24/four-years-post-dobbs-corporate-medias-abortion-fearmongering-proves-more-false-than-ever/?utm_source=rss&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=four-years-post-dobbs-corporate-medias-abortion-fearmongering-proves-more-false-than-ever","tags":[["t","Abortion"],["t","abortion pills"],["t","abortion propaganda"],["t","corporate media"],["t","Dobbs Decision"],["t","Dobbs v. Jackson"],["t","Dobbs v. Jackson Women’s Health Organization"],["t","ectopic"],["t","maternal mortality rate"],["t","mifepristone"],["t","miscarriage"],["t","New York Times"],["t","Washington Post"],["proxy","https://thefederalist.com/feed/#https%3A%2F%2Fthefederalist.com%2F2026%2F06%2F24%2Ffour-years-post-dobbs-corporate-medias-abortion-fearmongering-proves-more-false-than-ever%2F%3Futm_source%3Drss%26utm_medium%3Drss%26utm_campaign%3Dfour-years-post-dobbs-corporate-medias-abortion-fearmongering-proves-more-false-than-ever","rss"]]}
